<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=687&lastnode_id=2577">Darakryn</a> on 2001-11-15 01:44:47</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2><font face="Verdana" size=3><br>
Greetings Bloodhorde, <br><br><br>
I’ve not been on EQ for about 2 weeks now due to a problem with my ISP connection, so unfortunately I was not able to attend the meeting recently. I wanted to attend to say goodbye in person, but instead I will have to do it here in a post. <br><br><br>
I have left Terris Thule and moved to the new European server Antonius Bayle. Those of you who know me will know that I live in the UK and a server with more UK/European players on is a good thing. More people on my time zone, better connection with the server, plus all of my real life EQ playing friends have moved too. I’ve been in Bloodhorde for over a year, I’ve seen many people come and go, and it’s hard to leave a good guild and some good friends in Bloodhorde, I will miss many of you. <br><br><br>
Thank you for making my days in Bloodhorde interesting and entertaining. I have created a new character on Terris Thule just to contact some people; so don’t be alarmed if you see a naked newbie Darakryn running about ;) <br><br><br>
If any of you create characters on Antonius Bayle, don’t be a stranger. Take care all of you, it’s been great. <br><br><br>
<b><br>
*LINKDEAD* Darakryn < Bloodhorde ><br>
</b></font><br>
